# MVC backend

- Inherit JSON actions from `AdminApiController` (`ApiOk` / `ApiFail`).
- Protect JSON POSTs with `[ValidateAjaxAntiForgeryToken]`.
- Return view models, not EF entities, from JSON actions.
- Repositories: `Data/Repositories/Interfaces` + `Implementations`. Inject `ApplicationDbContext` in request scope.
- Bind new services/repos in `App_Start/NinjectConfig.cs`.
- Job-scoped `List` when no job: `{ success: false, data: { NeedsJob: true }, errors: ["Select a job first."] }`.

```csharp
[HttpGet]
public async Task<ActionResult> List(string search)
{
    return ApiOk(await _service.ListAsync(search));
}
```
